    each of these effects of \"Nekroz of Valkyrus\" once per turn.\r\n\u25CF When
    an opponent's monster declares an attack: You can banish 1 \"Nekroz\" card from
    your GY and discard this card; negate the attack, then end the Battle Phase.\r\n\u25CF
